          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Motrix user preferences (preferences.json) from %APPDATA%\\Motrix\\. Excludes Electron runtime caches, logs, session/resume state, and crash reports. Confidence: high - Motrix uses electron-store which defaults to app.getPath('userData') = %APPDATA%\\Motrix\\ on Windows. Authored secret warning: Motrix relays downloads through aria2c; if a proxy with credentials or tracker auth tokens are embedded in preferences.json, review the file before sharing. No standalone credential store is written to %APPDATA%\\Motrix\\."
